<title>USA: Wal-Mart September same-store sales rose.</title>
<headline>Wal-Mart September same-store sales rose.</headline>
<dateline>BENTONVILLE, Ark. 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		 1996	 1995	 Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	 $9,593     $8,474	 +13.2     +5.6</p>
<p>Year-to-date$59,011    $65,953	+11.8     +4.1</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>The company reported Sam's Club sales for the five week period were $1.8 billion, a 4.9 percent increase from 1.7 billion in the year-ago period.</p>
<p>Month is five weeks ended September 30.</p>
<p>Full company name is Wal-Mart Stores Inc.</p>
</text>
